IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ccc-core`
IMPORT `ccc32-nif-soirsa`

-- ccc32-tests-nif-soirsa.l4 -- tests for ccc32-nif-soirsa.l4 (2026 c. 16 ss 48 to 52; NOT IN FORCE).
-- Every expected value is decided by reading the provision, and written beside the assertion. A failing assertion is a finding.
-- The days on which the amending sections come into force are not in the sources: 1 June 2027 is made up.

§ `Sections 48 and 49 -- references read as of a day`
#ASSERT `s 490.02(3) (not in force) the day before which the provision referred to is read` `s 490.02(3) (not in force) the reference in subsection (1) to the definition designated offence` (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 26 10 2023)
#ASSERT `s 490.02(3) (not in force) the day before which the provision referred to is read` `s 490.02(3) (not in force) the reference in paragraph (2)(b) to subsection 490.012(3)` (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 26 10 2023)
#ASSERT `s 490.02(3) (not in force) the day before which the provision referred to is read` `s 490.02(3) (not in force) the reference in paragraph (2)(b) to subsection 227.01(3) of the National Defence Act` (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 6 2027)
#ASSERT `s 490.02(3) (not in force) the day before which the provision referred to is read` `s 490.02(3) (not in force) another reference` (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.022(4) (not in force) the day before which the definition referred to is read` `s 490.022(4) (not in force) the reference to the definition designated offence in subsection 490.011(1) of the Criminal Code` (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 26 10 2023)
#ASSERT `s 490.022(4) (not in force) the day before which the definition referred to is read` `s 490.022(4) (not in force) the reference to the definition designated offence in section 227 of the National Defence Act` (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 6 2027)
#ASSERT `s 490.022(4) (not in force) the day before which the definition referred to is read` `s 490.022(4) (not in force) another reference` (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Section 50 -- section 490.04`
-- (a): "on or after April 15, 2011 but before October 26, 2023" -- both ends of the window.
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012` (Date 15 4 2011) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012` (Date 14 4 2011) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012` (Date 25 10 2023) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012` (Date 26 10 2023) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (a.1): the window ends the day before the paragraph comes into force (1 June 2027, made up).
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a.1) (not in force) an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` (Date 15 4 2011) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a.1) (not in force) an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` (Date 14 4 2011) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a.1) (not in force) an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` (Date 31 5 2027) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(a.1) (not in force) an order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` (Date 1 6 2027) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (b): an obligation that BEGAN before October 26, 2023; one that began later is outside the paragraph's own wording (not covered, never FALSE).
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(b) (not in force) an obligation under section 490.02901` (Date 25 10 2023) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(b) (not in force) an obligation under section 490.02901` (Date 26 10 2023) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(b) (not in force) an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act` (Date 25 10 2023) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1)(b) (not in force) an obligation under section 36.1 of the International Transfer of Offenders Act` (Date 26 10 2023) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in paragraph (a), (a.1) or (b)` `s 490.04(1) (not in force) something else` (Date 25 10 2023) (Date 1 6 2027) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(2) (not in force) the person is permitted to apply under paragraph (1)(b)` TRUE (Date 26 10 2023) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(2) (not in force) the person is permitted to apply under paragraph (1)(b)` TRUE (Date 25 10 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(2) (not in force) the person is permitted to apply under paragraph (1)(b)` FALSE (Date 26 10 2023) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(3)(a) (not in force) a superior court of criminal jurisdiction is a court that may receive the application` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(3)(a) (not in force) a superior court of criminal jurisdiction is a court that may receive the application` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(3)(a) (not in force) a superior court of criminal jurisdiction is a court that may receive the application` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(3)(a) (not in force) a superior court of criminal jurisdiction is a court that may receive the application` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4)(a): an application under (1)(a), the offence prosecuted by indictment, two years or more, a victim under 18: the court shall not.
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4)(a.1): an application under (1)(a.1): no 'prosecuted by indictment' limb; two years or more and a victim under 18.
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (4)(b): the in-force limbs, taken as an input: where it answers yes, the court shall not; where not covered, not covered.
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- an application under neither paragraph: outside the subsection.
#ASSERT `s 490.04(4) (not in force) the court may make an exemption order` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.04(8) (not in force) a copy of the order made under section 490.012` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.04(8) (not in force) a copy of the order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the notice referred to in section 490.02901` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the Form 1 referred to in subparagraph 8(4)(a)(ii) of the International Transfer of Offenders Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.04(8) (not in force) something else` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.04(8) (not in force) the court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` FALSE `s 490.04(8) (not in force) a copy of the order made under section 490.012` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `Section 51 -- section 490.05`
#ASSERT `s 490.05(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in the replaced paragraphs` `s 490.05(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2024) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.05(1) (not in force) the order or obligation is one listed in the replaced paragraphs` `s 490.05(1)(a) (not in force) an order made under section 490.012` FALSE FALSE (Date 1 1 2024) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
