#ASSERT `s 490.05(5) (not in force) the provision applied to the offence in question with the longest maximum term of imprisonment` `s 490.05(5)(a.1) (not in force) an order under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` EQUALS JUST "subsection 227.02(2) of the National Defence Act"
#ASSERT `s 490.05(5) (not in force) the provision applied to the offence in question with the longest maximum term of imprisonment` `s 490.05(5)(b.1) (not in force) an obligation under section 227.06 of the National Defence Act` EQUALS JUST "paragraphs 227.09(3)(a) and (b) of the National Defence Act"
