§ `Section 52 -- section 490.06(2)`
#ASSERT `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the appeal court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.06(2) (not in force) a copy of the order made under section 490.012` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the appeal court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.06(2) (not in force) a copy of the order made under section 227.01 of the National Defence Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the appeal court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the notice referred to in section 490.02901` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the appeal court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the Form 1 referred to in subparagraph 8(4)(a)(ii) of the International Transfer of Offenders Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the appeal court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` TRUE `s 490.06(2) (not in force) something else` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 490.06(2) (not in force) the appeal court shall also make an order requiring the Royal Canadian Mounted Police to permanently remove the information from the database` FALSE `s 490.06(2) (not in force) a copy of the order made under section 490.012` EQUALS JUST FALSE
